GAPsurvey 2026.03.19 (March 19, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

NEW FUNCTIONALITY

- convert_xml_btd() added to extract temperature and depth data
  from SCS/Poseidon .xml event files and convert to BTD/BTH as a
  backup temperature/depth stream for the BT and CTD.
- parse_marport_nmea() added to extract temperature, depth, wing
  spread, door spread, net height, latitude, longitude, and
  date/time from raw Marport Scala 2 NMEA Sentence outputs.

BUG FIX

- interactive_point_editing() now handles NA values in individual
  data streams.


GAPsurvey 2026.02.24 (February 24, 2026)
----------------------------------------------------------------

NEW FUNCTIONALITY

- convert_tzdb_gps() and supporting functions added to extract
  data from TimeZero database (.tzdb) files and convert to .gps
  files that can be imported by Poseidon and Wheelhouse. The new
  functions require the RSQLite package.


GAPsurvey 2025.08.06 (August 6, 2025)
----------------------------------------------------------------

BUG FIX

- Changed approach to timezone conversion in convert_nmea_btd()
  to prevent incorrect times in R < 4.3.0 and made handling of
  $GPZDA strings more flexible.
